    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IMDEV-9434" href="https://jira/browse/IMDEV-9434">IMDEV-9434</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                 Оптимизация отчетов Аванкора для РДУ (ГрупповоеПерезаполнениеДокументов)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype">    Change Request
</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                <span class=" jira-issue-status-lozenge aui-lozenge jira-issue-status-lozenge-yellow jira-issue-status-lozenge-indeterminate aui-lozenge-subtle jira-issue-status-lozenge-max-width-medium" data-tooltip="&lt;span class=&quot;jira-issue-status-tooltip-title&quot;&gt;Escalated to Vendor&lt;/span&gt;">Escalated to Vendor</span>    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">           Medium
    </td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Chmykhalov, Aleksey
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Kukushkin, Vadim
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Chmykhalov, Aleksey
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Sep/26 8:44 +0300 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> 17/Sep/26 10:57 +0300 </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Sep/26 10:57 +0300 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
